                                                "example_id": "1875f172-db5b-44b0-bc20-cccf45052aa3",
                                                "sense_id": "a3682a44-c323-396c-959e-e3ac30606c91",
                                                "text": "Among the Ga, the people who are indigenous to Ghana's capital, Accra, a woman is entitled to a live sheep on the delivery of her 10th child. The word for it is \"nyongmato\". […] Lots of very important people among the Gas can testify to this. Unfortunately, I have not met any woman who has actually got a live sheep for having given birth to 10 children."
                                            }
